      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TRIAL KING (5) was safely held last time out, finishing sixth at this track over 305m behind Huntsman (18.09) in a OPEN. Was a winner the start prior. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and two minor placings to his credit. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. OLLIE LIMES (6) jumps from box 6 for the first time after scoring at this track (17.93) in a Grade 5. All three career wins have been at this trip. One of the key runners again. SOMETHING GOOD (1) gave a start after copping a check in running and missed the frame when a 7 length fifth (17.98) at this track in a OPEN. Should be in this for a long way. SECRET SUPER (2) was in the money last time at Murray Bridge Straight (16.82) in a OPEN, finishing a 2 length third. Has already won four times from this draw.",
